course: dictionary
lesson: 12884
title: Entitled: rights, names and attitude
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word entitled has three meanings, and the words around it show which one you need. If you are entitled to something, you have a right to it. «You are entitled to a refund if the shoes are broken.» The sentence is about getting your money back, so entitled means you have a right to it.
explain: A book, song or film can also be entitled something, which means that is its name. «The story is entitled The Lost Key.» The sentence is about a story, so entitled here means its title is The Lost Key.
explain: The third meaning is a criticism. «Ravi thinks the rules do not apply to him. He is so entitled.» The sentence shows that he acts as if he deserves special treatment when he does not, so entitled is not a kind word here.
fact: Entitled is an adjective, and it is also the past form of the verb entitle (entitle, entitles, entitled, entitling).
fact: «Entitled to» means you have a right to have or do something.
fact: «A book entitled» means the book has that name as its title.
fact: Calling someone «so entitled» is a criticism: they act spoilt and think the rules are not for them.
fact: A quick check: swap in a simple word such as «allowed» or «called» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «Every child is entitled to a free school lunch.» What does entitled mean? | *Has a right to it | Has lost it | Is hiding it | Is angry about it
exercise: «The film is entitled Winter Dreams.» What does entitled mean here? | It is very long | It is set in winter | It is watched by many people | *Its title is Winter Dreams
exercise: «Mia wants every turn and never waits, so she is so entitled.» What does the word suggest about Mia? | *She thinks she deserves special treatment | She is very kind and generous | She is lost | She is very tired
test: «Ben is entitled to three stickers for his good work.» What does entitled mean? | Is tired of | *Has a right to | Is hiding | Is angry about
test: Nadia reads a book «entitled Stars at Night». What does entitled mean here? | Lost | *Called | Opened | Ready
exam: Tom says, «She is so entitled, she never shares.» What does entitled suggest about her? | Kind and generous | She is happy to wait | *She acts as if she deserves special treatment | She is very tired
